Subject: [PATCH] feat(ajn): parallel audio/video sync (Watch / Listen at the
 same second, mini video overlay, shared position)

Adds startAtSeconds (one-shot) to NowPlayingMedia and MinimalPlayer, a shared per-episode position store,
twin lookup from the Radio catalog, Hard Switch buttons (Radio panel, mini dock, Player page), and a muted
mini video overlay slaved to the persistent audio element. Unit + browser regression tests added to CI.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
